{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF34", "score": 0.153, "document": "# FAM:SF34 | Study family SF34: Opponent lineup adaptation: shot mix when opposing rim big is off floor\n- observed_research_question: Opponent lineup adaptation: shot mix when opposing rim big is off floor\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Offenses attack the rim more when the opponent has no big on the floor.\n- observed_result: [CHT-075] DRIVE +0.82pp (SE 0.25 t=+3.3); POST_UP +0.43pp (SE 0.18 t=+2.4); 3PA -1.79pp (SE 0.31 t=-5.8); rim <=4ft +0.12pp (t=+0.4); PPP +0.008 (SE 0.007 t=+1.1).\n- observed_result: [TMP-020] rim_pct 0 bigs +0.123 (SE 0.295); tpa_pct -1.785 (SE 0.309); is_DRIVE +0.821 (SE 0.250); pts +0.008 (SE 0.007).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: none (no failure recorded)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: [CHT-075] Sub-1pp mix shifts with PPP t=+1.1; chat verdict WEAK/SMALL, will not carry a paper.\n- observed_failure_evidence: [TMP-020] Rim share +0.123 with SE 0.295.\n- observed_sample_and_power: [CHT-075] N=1.07M possessions"}, {"id": "FAM:SF32", "score": 0.105, "document": "# FAM:SF32 | Study family SF32: Opener recommendations vs personnel feasibility\n- observed_research_question: Opener recommendations vs personnel feasibility\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Rank-1 openers are within what the top-8 rotation can sustain.\n- observed_result: [APPA-033] 8/8 rank-1 openers CUT-centered and INFEASIBLE; worst gaps +9.6 to +15.9pp; CUT target 14-18% vs ceiling 2-6%.\n- observed_result: [APPM-025] All 24 openers seeded by CUT/PUTBACK/TRANSITION/PNR; CUT target exceeds stretch ceiling by +9.6 to +15.9pp for every team (e.g. PHI capacity 1.7% vs target 16.4%).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:BASE_RATE\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: [APPA-033] Optimizer ignores personnel; CUT target 3-10x stretch ceiling in every team-game.\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF11"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-TMP-009", "score": 0.093, "document": "# FAM:SF-TMP-009 | Study family SF-TMP-009: PULL_UP exposure-effect diagnostics\n- observed_research_question: PULL_UP exposure-effect diagnostics\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: The PULL_UP-specific decline with exposure is defensive adaptation rather than shooter selection/lineup artifact.\n- observed_result: With lineup FE: slope holding shot fixed -0.0255 (0.0061); shooter's earlier scored -0.1044 vs not scored +0.0693. No lineup FE: -0.0063 (0.0036); placebo other play types -0.0075 (0.0017).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:confounding\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:CONFOUNDING\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE\n- observed_failure_evidence: Effect shrinks from -0.0255 to -0.0063 without lineup FE and the same-shooter placebo on other play types is -0.0071/-0.0075, consistent with shooter-level confound.\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: artifact_found"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-017", "score": 0.085, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-017 | Study family SF-APPS-017: Execution conformance of observed mix vs recommended plan\n- observed_research_question: Execution conformance of observed mix vs recommended plan\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams' observed play-type mix in a game matches the model's recommended opener.\n- observed_result: Avg |delta| on leverage buckets 4.5pp to 24.0pp; 4 of 8 sides best matched opener #3, not rank-1.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- observed_failure_evidence: CUT and PNR muted for tagger floor; single-game horizon; no outcome comparison.\n- observed_sample_and_power: ~100 possessions per game\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-032\n- observed_method: Single 2025-26 playoff G1s, 4 games x 2 offenses; leverage-weighted gap between observed and recommended mix.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}], "n_results": 4}

Stage 2. Using the retrieval result above (follow-up tools are allowed within the tool budget), complete steps 4 to 9
and reply with the final action. Output schema (all fields required):
